    sill "从妓院选项卡中，您还可以访问 {b}马车{/b} 来建造家具和设置 {b}顾客选项{/b}。"

# game/BKhelp.rpy:631
translate chinese_simplified help_main_79c98d2c:

    # sill "The {b}Farm{/b} tab allows you to visit Gizel and her spooky farm. This will only lead to trouble, if you ask me."
    sill "“农场”选项卡可以让你参观吉泽尔和她那阴森恐怖的农场。依我看，这只会带来麻烦。"

# game/BKhelp.rpy:633
translate chinese_simplified help_main_d774e7a6:

    # sill "The {b}City{/b} tab allows you to visit the city and its available district. Give it a go if you get bored here!"
    sill "“城市”选项卡可让您访问城市及其各个区域。如果您觉得这里无聊，不妨试试看！"

# game/BKhelp.rpy:635
translate chinese_simplified help_main_9b92e5a1:

    # sill "The {b}Slave Market{/b} is bustling with sex slaves and the people who buy and sell them! Use it to get fresh slaves - if you can afford it."
    sill "奴隶市场熙熙攘攘，到处都是性奴以及买卖他们的人！如果你负担得起，就去那里获取新鲜的奴隶吧。"

# game/BKhelp.rpy:637
translate chinese_simplified help_main_f1d1ac57:

    # sill "The {b}Shop{/b} is where you can buy all sorts of mundane items for you or your girls. Maybe you'll find a bargain?"
    sill "这家{b}商店{/b}可以买到各种各样的日常用品，无论是给自己还是给女儿们买。说不定还能淘到便宜货呢？"

# game/BKhelp.rpy:639
translate chinese_simplified help_main_478cb481:

    # sill "The {b}Postings{/b} tab allows you to look for ads about quests and classes for your girl. It is useful to build up their skills and reputation."
    sill "“帖子”选项卡允许您查找有关您角色需要的任务和课程的广告。这有助于提升她们的技能和声望。"

# game/BKhelp.rpy:641
