    # sill "Sure thing! Just click on your name, and choose a new one. Oh, I'm curious!!! What's it gonna be?"
    sill "当然可以！点击你的名字，然后选择一个新的就行了。哦，我很好奇！你会选什么呢？"

# game/BKhelp.rpy:661
translate chinese_simplified help_MC_73802f03:

    # sill "First, let me tell you about your character class. Your class affects events in the game, your available spells and starting skills."
    sill "首先，让我来介绍一下你的角色职业。你的职业会影响游戏中的事件、你可用的法术和初始技能。"

# game/BKhelp.rpy:665
translate chinese_simplified help_MC_590d6db5:

    # sill "You are a warrior, a skilled fighter with a tough spirit. Your social skills are a bit lacking, though, if I may say so."
    sill "你是一名战士，一位身手矫健、意志坚韧的斗士。不过，恕我直言，你的社交能力还有待提高。"

# game/BKhelp.rpy:667
translate chinese_simplified help_MC_12ca863b:

    # you "Grumph."
    you "哼。"

# game/BKhelp.rpy:671
translate chinese_simplified help_MC_ac7724cb:

    # sill "You are a wizard, skilled in spellcasting and with some wits to match. Don't get into close combat, though, this is not your style."
    sill "你是一位法师，精通咒语，而且头脑也相当敏捷。不过，千万别近身搏斗，那不是你的风格。"

# game/BKhelp.rpy:673
translate chinese_simplified help_MC_0437b977:

    # you "I wouldn't want my hands to get dirty anyway. What with this expensive manicure I just got."
    you "我本来就不想弄脏手，毕竟刚做了这么贵的美甲。"

# game/BKhelp.rpy:677
translate chinese_simplified help_MC_f335efcb:

    # sill "You are good at barter and trade, and have learned the skills to survive in the streets. Magic is not your forte, however."
    sill "你擅长物物交换和交易，也掌握了在街头生存的技能。然而，魔法并非你的强项。"

# game/BKhelp.rpy:679
translate chinese_simplified help_MC_ee2db8f0:

    # you "Well, there were all those books to read, so... I figured I'd just sell them."
    you "嗯，那么多书要读，所以……我想我干脆把它们卖掉算了。"

# game/BKhelp.rpy:681
translate chinese_simplified help_MC_a414a0e4:

    # sill "You are currently level [MC.level]. Each new level will grant you a skill point which you may use to boost your skills."
    sill "您当前等级为[MC.level]。每次升级都会获得一个技能点，可用于提升您的技能。"

# game/BKhelp.rpy:683
translate chinese_simplified help_MC_dc0e11f0:

    # sill "You may also learn new {b}Spells{/b} and {b}Talents{/b}, so it's worth getting all the {b}prestige{/b} you can get."
    sill "你还可以学习新的{b}法术{/b}和{b}天赋{/b}，所以尽可能获得所有{b}声望{/b}是值得的。"

# game/BKhelp.rpy:685
translate chinese_simplified help_MC_7406d225:

    # sill "There are four skills you need to be concerned with: {b}Strength{/b}, {b}Spirit{/b}, {b}Charisma{/b}, and {b}Speed{/b}."
    sill "你需要关注四项技能：{b}力量{/b}、{b}精神{/b}、{b}魅力{/b}和{b}速度{/b}。"

# game/BKhelp.rpy:687
translate chinese_simplified help_MC_ba455e04:

    # sill "{b}Strength{/b} affects how well you perform physical tasks and hold your own in close combat. It also boosts your brothel security if you have remaining AP at the end of the day."
    sill "力量会影响你完成体力任务的能力以及在近战中自保的能力。如果你在一天结束时还有剩余行动点数，它还会提升你妓院的安全等级。"

# game/BKhelp.rpy:689
translate chinese_simplified help_MC_2e786f0e:

    # sill "{b}Spirit{/b} affects how well you can sense magic and cast spells. Spirit lowers the cost of class spells for all player classes."
    sill "精神属性会影响你感知魔法和施法的能力。精神属性可以降低所有玩家职业的职业法术消耗。"

# game/BKhelp.rpy:691
translate chinese_simplified help_MC_d2444d4a:

    # sill "{b}Charisma{/b} affects your social skills and people's reactions to dialog, including your girls."
    sill "魅力会影响你的社交技能和人们对你对话的反应，包括你的女孩们。"

# game/BKhelp.rpy:693
translate chinese_simplified help_MC_e1179f3e:

    # sill "{b}Speed{/b} affects how many actions are available to you every day."
    sill "速度会影响你每天可以执行的操作数量。"

# game/BKhelp.rpy:695
translate chinese_simplified help_MC_6154eff7:

    # sill "Finally, you can find information about your {b}beliefs{/b} and {b}alignment{/b}. This is impacted by the actions you take, and used during dialog and story events."
    sill "最后，您可以找到有关您的{b}信念{/b}和{b}立场{/b}的信息。这些信息会受到您采取的行动的影响，并在对话和故事事件中使用。"

# game/BKhelp.rpy:701
translate chinese_simplified help_MC_f6bcc6e6:

    # sill "Just click on the arrows to select your portrait. This is just for flavor and doesn't affect the game in any other way."
    sill "点击箭头即可选择头像。这只是为了增添趣味性，不会对游戏产生任何其他影响。"

# game/BKhelp.rpy:703
translate chinese_simplified help_MC_fda9a393:

    # sill "By the way, if you don't like those, did you know you can add more portraits in the {b}game\\MC\\{/b} folder?"
    sill "对了，如果你不喜欢这些头像，你知道你可以在 {b}game\\MC\\{/b} 文件夹中添加更多头像吗？"

# game/BKhelp.rpy:708
translate chinese_simplified help_MC_6816548b:

    # sill "{b}Prestige{/b} reflects your character's renown in Zan. Earning prestige allows you to level up and get skill points."
    sill "声望（Prestige）反映了你角色在赞恩（Zan）的声望。获得声望可以让你升级并获得技能点数。"

# game/BKhelp.rpy:710
translate chinese_simplified help_MC_2e21e849:

    # sill "You earn prestige everytime you or your girls have sex. You also earn prestige when a girl levels up."
    sill "你或你的女孩每次发生性行为都会获得声望。女孩升级时你也会获得声望。"

# game/BKhelp.rpy:712
translate chinese_simplified help_MC_98e36b67:

    # sill "You may use {b}Skill points{/b} to increase your {b}Strength{/b}, {b}Spirit{/b}, {b}Charisma{/b}, and {b}Speed{/b}, up to a maximum of 10."
    sill "你可以使用{b}技能点{/b}来提升你的{b}力量{/b}、{b}精神{/b}、{b}魅力{/b}和{b}速度{/b}，最高可达10。"

# game/BKhelp.rpy:717
translate chinese_simplified help_MC_8879ba31:

    # sill "It's easy! Just click on the item you want to use, and select 'use' or 'equip'. You can unequip an item in the same way."
    sill "很简单！只需点击你想使用的物品，然后选择“使用”或“装备”。卸下物品的方法也一样。"

# game/BKhelp.rpy:719
translate chinese_simplified help_MC_43e67d76:

    # sill "Please note that you can only use items that are intended {color=[c_main]}{b}for you{/b}{/color} and not {color=[c_pink]}{b}for your girls{/b}{/color}. Watch for the color in the item tab."
    sill "请注意，您只能使用专为您设计的物品，而不能使用专为您的女儿设计的物品。请留意物品标签中的颜色说明。"

# game/BKhelp.rpy:725
translate chinese_simplified help_MC_00da599b:

    # sill "You can learn new {b}Spells{/b} and {b}Talents{/b} from your character class when increasing your level."
    sill "提升等级时，你可以从你的角色职业中学习新的{b}法术{/b}和{b}天赋{/b}。"

# game/BKhelp.rpy:727
translate chinese_simplified help_MC_b3706761:

    # sill "Spells must be cast and cost mana. Talents are always active."
    sill "法术必须施放并消耗法力值。天赋始终生效。"

# game/BKhelp.rpy:729
translate chinese_simplified help_MC_045ee96f:

    # sill "After you learn a Spell, you can use it any time from the {b}Spellbook{/b}. Press 'K' for fast access to the Spellbook."
    sill "学会法术后，您可以随时从{b}法术书{/b}中使用它。按“K”键可快速打开法术书。"

# game/BKhelp.rpy:731
translate chinese_simplified help_MC_e6d656f6:

    # sill "Casting spells costs {b}Mana{/b}. Mana Points (MP) depend on your Spirit skill. They are replenished every day."
    sill "施放法术需要消耗法力值（Mana）。法力值（MP）取决于你的精神技能等级。法力值每天都会恢复。"

# game/BKhelp.rpy:733
translate chinese_simplified help_MC_a7da7429:

    # "{b}Left click{/b} on a spell in the spells tab to cast it."
    "{b}Left click{/b} on a spell in the spells tab to cast it."

# game/BKhelp.rpy:735
translate chinese_simplified help_MC_099c7f62:

    # sill "Did you know that you can {b}auto-cast{/b} spells? If you automate a spell, you will keep casting it every day - provided you have enough leftover MP."
    sill "你知道你可以自动施放法术吗？如果你设置了自动施法，只要你有足够的魔法值，它每天都会自动施放。"

# game/BKhelp.rpy:738
translate chinese_simplified help_MC_cd3fe0cf:

    # "{b}Right click{/b} on a spell in the spells tab to cast it. You can choose between auto-casting at night or in the morning by right-clicking again."
    "{b}Right click{/b} on a spell in the spells tab to cast it. You can choose between auto-casting at night or in the morning by right-clicking again."

# game/BKhelp.rpy:740
translate chinese_simplified help_MC_9f6110f2:

    # sill "But no matter what you do, you may only cast one spell of a given type every day. For instance, wizards can only have one aura active at any given time."
    sill "但无论你做什么，你每天只能施放一个特定类型的法术。例如，法师在任何时候都只能激活一种灵光。"

# game/BKhelp.rpy:743
translate chinese_simplified help_MC_746f86b6:

    # sill "Some spells are only active for one night, and some last until a specific event occurs. {b}Hover{/b} over a spell to see its description."
    sill "有些法术只持续一晚，有些则会持续到特定事件发生为止。将鼠标悬停在法术上即可查看其描述。"

