    # sill "However, you can also keep a girl sufficiently scared so that she won't refuse work or run away from you. Fear can be a powerful tool."
    sill "然而，你也可以让女孩感到足够害怕，以至于她不会拒绝工作或离开你。恐惧是一种强大的工具。"

# game/BKhelp.rpy:836
