    # sill "{b}Advertising{/b} helps grow the renown of your brothel and draws more and wealthier {b}customers{/b} to your brothel."
    sill "广告有助于提升妓院的名声，吸引更多更有钱的顾客光顾。"

# game/BKhelp.rpy:1267
translate chinese_simplified help_advertising_714a1312:

    # sill "Advertising has three different effects: it boosts {b}brothel reputation{/b}, {b}customer attraction{/b} and {b}customer budgets{/b}."
    sill "广告有三种不同的效果：它可以提升妓院的声誉、吸引顾客和增加顾客的预算。"

# game/BKhelp.rpy:1269
translate chinese_simplified help_advertising_133d9e77:

    # sill "Each of these effects is strengthened by {b}advertising power{/b}."
    sill "这些效果都会因广告力量而增强。"

# game/BKhelp.rpy:1277
translate chinese_simplified help_advertising_menu_b463b8ec:

    # sill "Some {b}customers{/b} will come to your brothel every night. At least one will show up no matter what, but your {b}brothel reputation{/b} and {b}customer attraction{/b} can increase that manyfold."
    sill "总会有一些顾客每晚光顾你的妓院。无论如何，至少会有一个顾客出现，但你的妓院声誉和顾客吸引力可以成倍增长。"

# game/BKhelp.rpy:1279
translate chinese_simplified help_advertising_menu_c046054f:

    # sill "There are different {b}customer populations{/b} in Zan, each with a different level of difficulty and rewards, as well as some special effect."
    sill "Zan 中有不同的顾客群体，每个群体都有不同的难度和奖励，以及一些特殊效果。"

# game/BKhelp.rpy:1281
translate chinese_simplified help_advertising_menu_f889f1f4:

    # sill "You will mostly serve only {b}beggars{/b} at first, though. But as your brothel increases in rank and you reach higher districts, more customer populations will become available."
    sill "起初，你主要接待的可能只有乞丐。但随着你的妓院等级提升，业务范围扩展至更高区域，就会有更多顾客群体出现。"

# game/BKhelp.rpy:1283
translate chinese_simplified help_advertising_menu_c9b423ad:

    # sill "When that happens, you can choose which populations to attract in the {b}customer options{/b} tab. Not only that, but you can choose to allow or restrict customer populations on a girl by girl basis if you need to."
    sill "届时，您可以在“客户选项”选项卡中选择要吸引的客户群体。不仅如此，您还可以根据需要逐个女孩地选择允许或限制客户群体。"

# game/BKhelp.rpy:1285
translate chinese_simplified help_advertising_menu_e9a0c292:

    # sill "Harder customers also have a higher {b}customer budget{/b}. Keep that in mind as your brothel grows to make the most money out of it."
    sill "难缠的顾客往往消费预算也更高。随着妓院规模的扩大，要牢记这一点，才能最大程度地提高收入。"

# game/BKhelp.rpy:1289
translate chinese_simplified help_advertising_menu_463efcf4:

    # sill "{b}Brothel reputation{/b} receives a boost from advertising every night. It is also affected negatively or positively by your {b}customers' satisfaction{/b}."
    sill "妓院的声誉每晚都会因广告而提升。顾客的满意度也会对其产生正面或负面的影响。"

# game/BKhelp.rpy:1291
translate chinese_simplified help_advertising_menu_39ad60d5:

    # sill "{b}Brothel reputation{/b} is nice because it draws customers to your brothel for free, unlike advertising. It does {b}decay{/b} over time, though, especially in higher districts."
    sill "妓院声誉的好处在于，它能免费吸引顾客，不像广告那样需要人工投入。不过，声誉会随着时间推移而下降，尤其是在地段较高的区域。"

# game/BKhelp.rpy:1293
translate chinese_simplified help_advertising_menu_c166846a:

    # sill "Of course, it will cost more brothel reputation to attract higher rank customers than the usual riff-raff. If you need more customers than your current reputation allows, blocking some higher rank populations from coming in {b}customer options{/b} could be a way to do it."
    sill "当然，吸引高等级顾客需要消耗妓院更高的声望，而不是普通的闲杂人等。如果你需要的顾客数量超过了你目前的声望所能承受的范围，那么阻止某些高等级人群进入{b}顾客选项{/b}或许是一种方法。"

# game/BKhelp.rpy:1295
translate chinese_simplified help_advertising_menu_fe19d71f:

    # sill "And a word of warning: {b}Unhappy customers{/b} may really drag your reputation down, especially at higher ranks. It is best to focus on drawing only as many customers as you can serve to the brothel to avoid grumbling."
    sill "还有一点要提醒你：不满的顾客会严重损害你的声誉，尤其是在等级较高的时候。为了避免顾客抱怨，最好只吸引你能服务的顾客。"

# game/BKhelp.rpy:1299
translate chinese_simplified help_advertising_menu_60dc3fd0:

    # sill "{b}Customer attraction{/b} is a temporary boost your advertising girls will bring to the total number of customers that come to the brothel."
    sill "{b}顾客吸引力{/b}是指你的广告女郎能暂时提升到妓院的顾客总数。"

# game/BKhelp.rpy:1301
translate chinese_simplified help_advertising_menu_39508306:

    # sill "If you lower advertising, though, you will lose those extra customers. This is the main difference between {b}brothel reputation{/b} and {b}customer attraction{/b}."
    sill "但如果你减少广告投入，就会失去这些额外的顾客。这就是妓院声誉和顾客吸引力之间的主要区别。"

# game/BKhelp.rpy:1303
translate chinese_simplified help_advertising_menu_15a8ef4b:

    # sill "Ultimately, if you want many customers to come, it is good to keep advertising high."
    sill "归根结底，如果你想吸引很多顾客，就应该保持高水平的广告投入。"

# game/BKhelp.rpy:1305
translate chinese_simplified help_advertising_menu_2f8db18d:

    # sill "One day, you may even be able to unlock a way to increase {b}customer attraction{/b}, at the expense of {b}customer budgets{/b}."
    sill "有一天，你甚至可能找到一种方法，以牺牲客户预算为代价，来增加{b}客户吸引力{/b}。"

# game/BKhelp.rpy:1308
translate chinese_simplified help_advertising_menu_3a3136fa:

    # sill "Each customer has a {b}maximum budget{/b} he's ready to spend on activities at your brothel."
    sill "每个顾客都有一个他愿意在你的妓院里花费的{b}最高预算{/b}。"

# game/BKhelp.rpy:1310
translate chinese_simplified help_advertising_menu_cbb3a1de:

    # sill "Customers have a separate budget for {b}entertainment{/b}, such as hanging by the tavern or club, and {b}whoring{/b}. Their budget for whoring is higher, naturally. But if you want to get the most value out of a customer, entertaining him first is a good idea."
    sill "顾客的娱乐预算（例如在酒吧或俱乐部消遣）和嫖娼预算是分开的。当然，嫖娼预算更高。但如果你想最大程度地利用顾客，先让他享受娱乐是个好主意。"

# game/BKhelp.rpy:1313
translate chinese_simplified help_advertising_menu_e75811ac:

    # sill "Advertising increases {b}customer budgets{/b}. In rare cases, it is also possible to convince customers to go over their allowance. Some girl perks help with that."
    sill "广告会增加顾客的预算。在极少数情况下，甚至有可能说服顾客超出预算。一些女性专属福利有助于实现这一点。"

# game/BKhelp.rpy:1315
translate chinese_simplified help_advertising_menu_9ee4e8dd:

    # sill "Of course, this is only their {b}maximum{/b} allowance. If your girls perform badly, they will pay a lot less regardless of their budget."
    sill "当然，这只是她们的最高限额。如果你的女孩们表现不佳，无论她们的预算是多少，她们最终支付的金额都会少得多。"

# game/BKhelp.rpy:1317
translate chinese_simplified help_advertising_menu_6001b4b3:

    # sill "Ultimately, if you want customers to spend a lot, it is good to keep advertising high."
    sill "归根结底，如果你想让顾客多花钱，就应该保持高额的广告投入。"

# game/BKhelp.rpy:1319
translate chinese_simplified help_advertising_menu_bb561c66:

    # sill "One day, you may even be able to unlock a way to increase {b}customer budgets{/b}, at the expense of {b}customer attraction{/b}."
    sill "有一天，你甚至可能找到一种方法来增加{b}客户预算{/b}，即使这意味着降低{b}客户吸引力{/b}。"

# game/BKhelp.rpy:1323
translate chinese_simplified help_advertising_menu_82913fb0:

    # sill "{b}Advertising power{/b} is influenced by your advertising girls' current {b}outfits{/b}."
    sill "广告效果受广告女郎当前服装的影响。"

# game/BKhelp.rpy:1325
translate chinese_simplified help_advertising_menu_df2089fa:

    # sill "There may be a way to unlock new outfits in the future."
    sill "未来或许会有办法解锁新的服装。"

# game/BKhelp.rpy:1329
translate chinese_simplified help_advertising_menu_0c9bddb4:

    # you "I'm good now, thanks."
    you "我现在没事了，谢谢。"

# game/BKhelp.rpy:1338
translate chinese_simplified help_wagon_bdaee514:

    # carpenter "This baby here is where I ply my trade, boss."
    carpenter "老板，我就靠这玩意儿谋生。"

# game/BKhelp.rpy:1340
translate chinese_simplified help_wagon_3ace83c3:

    # carpenter "{b}Furniture-making{/b}, of course. I also do decorations. Heck, I can even arrange a whole room real nice if you have the resources."
    carpenter "当然，我还会做家具。我也做装饰。如果你有资源，我甚至可以把整个房间布置得非常漂亮。"

# game/BKhelp.rpy:1342
translate chinese_simplified help_wagon_7de54d46:

    # carpenter "I need {b}Resources{/b} to build stuff. That was our deal, remember?"
    carpenter "我需要{b}资源{/b}来构建东西。我们之前是这么约定的，记得吗？"

# game/BKhelp.rpy:1344
translate chinese_simplified help_wagon_c1d74bcf:

    # carpenter "Resources can be found all over town, I hear."
    carpenter "我听说城里到处都能找到资源。"

# game/BKhelp.rpy:1346
translate chinese_simplified help_wagon_92544efd:

    # carpenter "When you give me a new task, I might take a few days to complete it. An' I don't like to be interrupted. Make sure to get yer priorities straight."
    carpenter "你给我布置新任务时，我可能需要几天时间才能完成。而且我不喜欢被打扰。请务必分清轻重缓急。"

# game/BKhelp.rpy:1348
translate chinese_simplified help_wagon_a9e5dec2:

    # carpenter "After you build something, it cannot be undone. But some furniture will open new options for you, or even be switched on/off. Check the {b}Customer options{/b} tab to learn more."
    carpenter "家具一旦组装完成，便无法撤销。但有些家具可以为您开启新的功能，甚至可以开启/关闭。请查看“客户选项”选项卡了解更多信息。"

# game/BKhelp.rpy:1354
translate chinese_simplified help_customers_fa2a1a82:

    # carpenter "Heya boss, it's me."
    carpenter "嘿老板，是我。"

# game/BKhelp.rpy:1356
translate chinese_simplified help_customers_b19eac2c:

    # carpenter "You might've noticed, building new furniture has opened new {b}Customer options{/b} for ya."
    carpenter "您可能已经注意到，制造新家具为您开启了新的{b}客户选择{/b}。"

# game/BKhelp.rpy:1358
translate chinese_simplified help_customers_5ee181c4:

    # carpenter "It's real simple: choosing which furniture and decoration to display will attract different categories of customers."
    carpenter "道理很简单：选择展示哪些家具和装饰品会吸引不同类型的顾客。"

# game/BKhelp.rpy:1360
translate chinese_simplified help_customers_78e58e25:

    # carpenter "Customers come from one of the many populations in Zan, from the rabble to the high 'n' mighty. Check out their characteristics by hovering over their portrait: some might surprise you."
    carpenter "顾客来自赞恩的各个阶层，从平民百姓到权贵阶层都有。将鼠标悬停在他们的头像上，即可查看他们的特征：有些特征可能会让你感到惊讶。"

# game/BKhelp.rpy:1363
translate chinese_simplified help_customers_8cb7b3c2:

    # carpenter "They also have different budgets and whatnot. Your pink-haired girlfriend tried to explain all this to me once, it made my head hurt."
    carpenter "他们的预算也各不相同，等等。你那个粉头发的女朋友曾经试图跟我解释这一切，结果听得我头都大了。"

# game/BKhelp.rpy:1365
translate chinese_simplified help_customers_d4095bcf:

    # carpenter "There are more subtle ways customers differ, though. Some just like different things for entertainment, in and out of the sack."
    carpenter "不过，顾客之间的差异还有更微妙的地方。有些人喜欢的娱乐方式不同，无论是在床上还是床下。"

# game/BKhelp.rpy:1367
translate chinese_simplified help_customers_1aa53b4a:

    # carpenter "I've designed some furniture that can attract different types so that you can tailor it to your liking."
    carpenter "我设计了一些能够吸引不同类型人群的家具，您可以根据自己的喜好进行定制。"

# game/BKhelp.rpy:1369
translate chinese_simplified help_customers_642f217c:

    # carpenter "Just remind 'em, though: the next one who tries to pinch my ass gets his skull split with a 10-pound hammer."
    carpenter "不过，你得提醒他们：下一个敢捏我屁股的人，我会用10磅重的锤子砸碎他的脑袋。"

