    # sill "Zan is home to {b}six districts{/b}, from the sprawling Slums outside the city walls to the heart of the city's power: the King's Hold."
    sill "赞城有六个区，从城墙外广阔的贫民窟到城市权力的中心：国王的堡垒。"

