    # sill "In time, you will be able to unlock new districts and relocate your brothel to fancier areas."
    sill "随着时间的推移，你将能够解锁新的区域，并将你的妓院搬迁到更高级的地区。"

# game/BKhelp.rpy:1391
translate chinese_simplified help_districts_12dc4af0:

    # sill "You need a proper brothel {b}license{/b} to move out of the Slums. Accessing the more upscale districts requires an even higher license."
    sill "你需要一张正规的妓院许可证才能搬出贫民窟。而要进入更高级的地区，则需要更高级别的许可证。"

# game/BKhelp.rpy:1393
translate chinese_simplified help_districts_e9183595:

    # sill "When you advance in the game, you will be able to {b}relocate{/b} your brothel to a fancier district. Relocating your brothel will allow you to improve the quality and size of your operation, while increasing both the difficulty and rewards of the game. You may relocate only once every chapter."
    sill "随着游戏进程的推进，您将能够把妓院搬迁到更高级的区域。搬迁妓院可以提升您妓院的品质和规模，同时也会增加游戏的难度和奖励。每个章节您只能搬迁一次。"

# game/BKhelp.rpy:1397
translate chinese_simplified help_districts_ad1d2b41:

    # sill "New licenses and brothel relocation will become available as you advance in the game."
    sill "随着游戏进程的推进，您将获得新的许可证并可以搬迁妓院。"

